+  // (clean on their own) instead of the concrete class: `rpcMethods` feeds
+  // the wire-protocol method table (via `JsonRpcMethodProvider`, which
+  // `Launcher.Builder` already prefers over its own class scan when
+  // present), and `rpcDispatch` feeds local method dispatch (a hand-rolled
+  // `Endpoint` in `dotty.tools.languageserver.Main`, since
+  // `GenericEndpoint`/`ServiceEndpoints.toEndpoint` has no equivalent
+  // override hook).
+  private val serviceInterfaces: List[Class[?]] =
